                        "glosses": [
                            "In a dainty manner, delicately."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "29115029-4f1b-49aa-9cfb-fab56405f94b",
                                "sense_id": "ff5a7aa2-0251-3f52-950c-195ee416c0d0",
                                "text": "SATURNINUS: Go fetch them hither to us presently.\nTITUS: Why, there they are, both baked in that pie,\nWhereof their mother daintily hath fed,\nEating the flesh that she herself hath bred."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a44a05e-106e-41d1-9dc7-287bcdb11258",
                                "sense_id": "ff5a7aa2-0251-3f52-950c-195ee416c0d0",
                                "text": "Has he beſpoke, what will he have a brace, / Or but one Partridge, or a ſhort-leg'd Hen, / Daintyly carbonado'd?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3afd5774-c9d1-48f1-bc1b-873dd5a24409",
                                "sense_id": "ff5a7aa2-0251-3f52-950c-195ee416c0d0",
                                "text": "At the last moment Mollie, the foolish, pretty white mare who drew Mr. Jones's trap, came mincing daintily in, chewing at a lump of sugar."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42aeda45-4ca3-4a15-b197-2644ff85a0f6",
                                "sense_id": "ff5a7aa2-0251-3f52-950c-195ee416c0d0",
                                "text": "[Allegra]'s daintily readjusting her stance."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
